      "text": "[~ 4]"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0030_doctor_04",
      "hash": "fe9f2f5c18ed1f36",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 5]"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0030_doctor_05",
      "hash": "fe9f305c18ed20e9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 6]"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0030_new_doctor_01",
      "hash": "e79395d568abbc54",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士：波波们，\\n谢谢你们了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0030_new_doctor_09",
      "hash": "e7938dd568abaebc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "多亏了你们帮忙，我才能\\n对你们有了更深入的了解！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0030_new_doctor_02",
      "hash": "e79398d568abc16d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "喔～！这不是[VAR TRNAME(0000)]嘛！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0030_new_doctor_10",
      "hash": "e79010d568a8a47e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "对了对了！\\n今天是把宝可梦\\r\\n交给你和[VAR TRNAME(0001)]的日子！\\r\\n那么，我们快去研究所吧……"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0030_new_doctor_03",
      "hash": "e79397d568abbfba",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "嗯～？"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0030_new_doctor_04",
      "hash": "e79392d568abb73b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "怎、怎么回事！？"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main0030_new_doctor_05",
      "hash": "e79391d568abb588",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士：以第一次来说，\\n你真的做得很好！"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main0030_new_doctor_11",
      "hash": "e79011d568a8a631",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "去吧！\\n捡起那个精灵球，\\c\\n为你捉到的[VAR POKNAME(0002)]\\n起一个名字吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main0030_new_doctor_06",
      "hash": "e79394d568abbaa1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "什么～！？"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_main0030_new_doctor_07",
      "hash": "e79393d568abb8ee",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "真、真是个精力充沛的家伙啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_main0030_new_doctor_08",
      "hash": "e7938ed568abb06f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "等一下！给我站住！"
    }
  ],
